[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0817","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0817.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0667","title":"Caldera Linux gpm 本地文件删除与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Caldera Linux 的 gpm（通用鼠标服务）存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者利用该服务对文件操作的权限控制缺陷，可通过发送特制请求删除系统任意文件或触发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Caldera Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需认证即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0667"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"立即应用 Caldera 安全公告 CSSA-2000-024.0 提供的补丁，升级 gpm 至修复版本。如无法获取官方补丁，可限制本地用户对 gpm 的访问权限，或禁用 gpm 服务（`/etc/init.d/gpm stop`）。由于 Caldera Linux 已停止支持，建议迁移至受支持的 Linux 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0273.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1512","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0667","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2000/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0667.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0667.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0667.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0817.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0526","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0673","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0/2000 NetBIOS Name Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 和 Windows 2000 系统中的 NetBIOS 名称服务器（NBNS）协议存在欺骗漏洞。NBNS 协议在设计上未实现身份认证机制，远程攻击者可伪造 Name Conflict 或 Name Release 类型的 UDP 数据报并发送给目标系统，诱导 NBNS 错误地释放或冲突已注册的 NetBIOS 名称记录，从而导致合法主机名称解析失败，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 操作系统中的 NetBIOS 名称解析服务，CVSS 评分为 5.0，攻击者仅需网络可达且无需任何认证即可利用此漏洞发起攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0673"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"立即安装微软安全更新 KB244941（适用于 Windows 2000）；Windows NT 4.0 用户需升级至 Windows 2000 或更高版本。如无法立即修补，在防火墙或路由器上阻断 UDP 137 端口（NetBIOS Name Service）的入站流量，仅允许内网可信主机访问该端口。同时建议关闭不必要的 NetBIOS over TCP/IP 设置（网络连接属性 → Internet 协议 → 高级 → WINS → 禁用 NetBIOS），并将系统迁移至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows Server 2022 或 Windows 11）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/044.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1514","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1515","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-047","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5035","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20106","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0673.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0673.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0673.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0673.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0673","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0673.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0673.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0673.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0673.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0673.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0521","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0521.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0668","title":"Conectiva/RedHat Linux pam_console PAM模块 远程权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 系统中 pam_console PAM 模块存在权限验证缺陷，当显示管理器（如 gdm 或 kdm）启用 XDMCP 协议时，远程用户可绕过正常认证机制获取系统控制台访问权限，并能够重启系统。该漏洞影响 Conectiva 4.x/5.x 及 RedHat 6.x 等版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，导致系统可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0668"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"安装 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2000-044 提供的更新补丁，升级 pam_console 模块至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在 gdm/kdm 等显示管理器中禁用 XDMCP 协议（将 /etc/X11/gdm/gdm.conf 中 Enable=false），或通过防火墙限制 XDMCP 端口（UDP 177）的远程访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0398.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0455.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-044.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1513","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5001","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20105","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0668","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2000/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0668.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0668.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0668.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0521.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0778","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0778.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0637","title":"Microsoft Excel 97/2000 Register.ID 函数任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 97 及 2000 版本中的 REGISTER.ID 函数存在代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过诱使用户打开特制的 Excel 文件，利用该函数加载恶意的 .dll 动态链接库文件，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞需要用户交互（打开恶意文件）才能触发，属于本地攻击向量，成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。受影响版本包括 Excel 97 和 Excel 2000。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0637"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-051 提供的补丁：Excel 2000 用户安装 KB269252 更新，Excel 97 用户安装 KB269263 更新。该补丁会禁用工作表中的 REGISTER.ID 函数，阻止恶意 DLL 被调用。如无法安装补丁，可考虑禁用 Excel 中的 XLM 宏功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1451","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=396B3F8F.9244D290%40nat.bg","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0637","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0637.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-977m-wr29-gj29/GHSA-977m-wr29-gj29.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0637.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0637.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d6c4749-af28-4ca8-a71d-d396d56b559a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0778.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0515","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0664","title":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 目录遍历漏洞","description":"AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.0.6 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送包含 URL 编码 %2E 的畸形路径请求（如 `/%2e%2e/%2e%2e/` 绕过常规 `../` 过滤），实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 全系列早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可读取系统敏感文件（如密码文件、配置文件），危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0664"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"立即升级到 AnalogX SimpleServer:WWW 1.07 及以上版本（当前最新为 1.24），该版本已修复通过 %2E URL 编码绕过目录遍历检查的问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，拦截包含 %2E%2E 或类似编码的路径遍历请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0374.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm","http://www.osvdb.org/388","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1508","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4999","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20103","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0664","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2000/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0664.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0664.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0664.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0807","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0807.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0663","title":"Microsoft Windows NT/2000 Shell 相对路径劫持本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows NT 和 Windows 2000 系统中，Shell 可执行文件 Explorer.exe 的注册表项使用了相对路径而非绝对路径，导致系统启动时会在 %Systemdrive% 目录下搜索 Explorer.exe。本地攻击者可将特洛伊木马程序命名为 Explorer.exe 放置于该目录，当系统重启或用户登录时，木马会以当前用户权限自动执行，从而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞被命名为\"相对 Shell 路径\"漏洞，影响 Windows NT 及 Windows 2000 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0663"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-052 提供的补丁。Windows NT 4.0 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=2055A234-6CFD-46ED-879B-F8A742EE1345，Windows 2000 用户下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=C9CB67CD-E52E-4937-A82A-9C8FC0B2D581。如无法安装补丁，作为临时缓解措施，限制交互式登录用户对 %Systemdrive% 根目录的写入权限，移除 Everyone 组的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=269049","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1507","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0663","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2000/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0663.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0663.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0663.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0807.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0799","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0799.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0659","title":"AnalogX proxy server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX Proxy 代理服务器 4.04 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 SOCKS4 CONNECT 请求中发送超长用户名字段触发缓冲区溢出，导致代理服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有使用受影响版本的 AnalogX Proxy 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0659"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"立即将 AnalogX Proxy 升级至 4.05 或更高版本。如无法升级，在防火墙规则中限制外部 IP 对代理服务器 1080 端口（SOCKS 默认端口）的访问，仅允许可信内网段连接，并监控异常长度的 SOCKS4 CONNECT 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e9d9f63ec95233a18ff0c401191fddd414b539a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0659.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0659","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0659.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0659.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vq3q-gw2w-fwwv/GHSA-vq3q-gw2w-fwwv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0659.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1504/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0799.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0796","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0796.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0658","title":"AnalogX Proxy Server POP3 USER 命令缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX Proxy Server 4.04及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向POP3协议发送超长的USER命令触发该漏洞，导致代理服务程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响使用AnalogX Proxy Server的所有系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0658"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"建议立即将 AnalogX Proxy 升级至 4.05 及以上版本（当前最新为 4.15），可从 analogx.com 下载更新。如无法升级，可在防火墙中限制对 POP3 端口（110）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并限制 USER 命令输入长度以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0658.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0658","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0658.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0658.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9jv8-f4cc-g337/GHSA-9jv8-f4cc-g337.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0658.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--eb76beea-d9a0-40de-b323-3a9221bd3820.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1504/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0796.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0794","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0794.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0657","title":"AnalogX Proxy Server SMTP HELO命令缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnalogX 代理服务器 4.04 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 协议发送超长 HELO 命令触发该漏洞，导致代理服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有运行受影响版本的 AnalogX 代理服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0657"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"升级到 AnalogX Proxy 4.05 或更高版本（最新版为 4.15），该版本已修复 SMTP/POP3/FTP 处理中的溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在防火墙或代理服务器层面限制 SMTP HELO 命令长度，或禁用 SMTP 代理转发功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0657.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0657","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0657.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0657.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Wollny/CVE-2000-0657.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2xfg-fq6q-8vvj/GHSA-2xfg-fq6q-8vvj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0657.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0657.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--63c9f350-62a5-48bd-8935-8f461e7be081.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0794.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0512","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0656","title":"AnalogX Proxy 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-00001\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-0656\", \"GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"AnalogX Proxy 4.04 及更早版本 FTP 协议缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞\"\ndescription = \"AnalogX Proxy 4.04 及更早版本的 FTP 代理服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向 FTP 端口发送超长 USER 命令，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致代理服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。攻击复杂度低，危害性中等。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\", \"exploitdb\"]\npublished = \"2000-07-25\"\nupdated = \"2000-07-25\"\nremediation = \"升级到 AnalogX Proxy 4.05 或更高版本。该漏洞已在 4.05 版本中修复，用户应从官方渠道获取最新版本进行更新。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0656\", \"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099\", \"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099\"]\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"\n\nPOC-AVE-2000-00001\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2000-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-0656 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-0656\"]\ndescription = \"通过向 AnalogX Proxy FTP 端口发送超长 USER 命令触发缓冲区溢出导致拒绝服务\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-0656\", \"AVE-2000-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:21\"\n\n[[poc.requests.raws]]\ntype = \"send\"\ncontent = \"USER AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\\r\\n\"\n\n[[poc.requests.raws]]\ntype = \"receive\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"421\", \"Timeout\", \"Connection refused\"]\nexpect = true\n\nNO_EXP\n","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0656"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"tags.<value>[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-00001\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-0656\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"AnalogX Proxy 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞\"\ndescription = \"AnalogX Proxy 4.04及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向FTP代理服务发送超长USER命令（约370字节），触发边界条件错误导致代理服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞同样影响SMTP代理（HELO命令）和POP3代理（USER命令），攻击者只需建立TCP连接并发送特制载荷即可触发。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\"]\npublished = \"2000-07-25\"\nupdated = \"2000-07-25\"\nremediation = \"升级至AnalogX Proxy 4.5或更高版本。官方在4.5版本中修复了该缓冲区溢出问题，4.6版本确认不受影响。可从AnalogX官方网站（http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm）下载更新。若无法升级，建议限制对代理服务的网络访问。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html\", \"http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm\", \"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504\", \"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099\"]\nexp_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099\"]\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"\n\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2000-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-0656 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-0656\"]\ndescription = \"检测AnalogX Proxy FTP代理服务是否存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，通过发送超长USER命令触发拒绝服务\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-0656\", \"AVE-2000-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:21\"\n\n[poc.requests.raw]\ntype = \"tcp\"\ncontent = \"USER @userfriendly.org\\n\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"220\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[info]\nid = \"EXP-AVE-2000-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-0656 EXP\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-0656\"]\ndescription = \"完整利用AnalogX Proxy缓冲区溢出漏洞，通过发送超长命令导致代理服务崩溃，实现远程拒绝服务攻击\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-0656\", \"AVE-2000-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:21\"\n\n[poc.requests.raw]\ntype = \"tcp\"\ncontent = \"USER @userfriendly.org\\n\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"220\"]\nexpect = true\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0360.html","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/proxy.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1504","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20099","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0656","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0656.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2/GHSA-xfg8-c4cc-3fg2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0656.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--227f18ce-c4a2-47d9-93e9-35e551fcd06f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1504/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0510","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0510.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0655","title":"Netscape Communicator JPEG注释堆溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本在处理 JPEG 图片中的注释字段时存在堆溢出漏洞。当 JPEG 图片包含一个非法字段长度（值为 1）的注释块时，程序在堆内存分配和拷贝过程中发生溢出，导致内存破坏。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 JPEG 图片，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中打开，即可触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.x 全系版本，攻击条件低，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0655"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"立即升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.74 或更高版本，该版本修复了 JPEG 注释长度字段校验缺失导致的堆溢出问题。如无法升级，建议停止使用 Netscape Communicator，改用 Mozilla Firefox 或其它现代浏览器。Linux 发行版用户可通过 Red Hat RHSA-2000-046、FreeBSD-SA-00:39 或 NetBSD-SA2000-011 提供的补丁包进行更新。临时缓解措施可在邮件/新闻客户端中禁用自动加载图片功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0456.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0116.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_60.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-046.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1503","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3D200007242356.DAA01274%40false.com","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2000-August/000016.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0655.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0655","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0655.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0655.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-5cwq-wmjx-47pq/GHSA-5cwq-wmjx-47pq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0655.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0510.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0510.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0510.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0503","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0652","title":"IBM WebSphere Application Server 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere Application Server 2.0/3.0/3.0.2.1 存在源代码泄露漏洞（Showcode）。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向 InvokerServlet 发送包含 \"/servlet/file\" 字符串的特制 URL，直接读取 JSP、Servlet 等可执行 Web 文件的源代码。该漏洞可导致敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接凭证等关键信息泄露，为后续攻击提供跳板。攻击条件低，仅需目标开放默认 Servlet 端口即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0652"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"升级 IBM WebSphere Application Server 至 3.5 及以上版本，或禁用默认的 InvokerServlet（在 web.xml 中注释或删除 InvokerServlet 映射）。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置 URL 访问控制规则，拦截包含 \"/servlet/file\" 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0342.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1500","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5012","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20097","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0652","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0652.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78c2-6wr9-gc88/GHSA-78c2-6wr9-gc88.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/IBM%20WebSphere%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%8F%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8Cweb%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%BA%90%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-0652).html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0652.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0652.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--221cf026-9cb3-4632-89dd-05eeb0547ab7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0503.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0503.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0784","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0784.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0646","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 文件传输路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"WFTPD 2.4.1 RC11 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 存在路径信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需在文件传输过程中向 FTP 服务器发送 STATUS（STAT）命令，即可获取被传输文件在服务器上的真实绝对路径名。该漏洞利用条件低，攻击者通过网络即可触发，可能导致服务器目录结构等敏感信息泄露，为进一步攻击提供信息支撑。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0646"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 WFTPD/WFTPD Pro 至 2.41 以上版本（官方已修复此漏洞）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代 FTP 服务器（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙限制 FTP 服务仅允许可信 IP 访问，并禁用匿名用户执行 STAT 命令的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0646.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0646","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0646.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0646.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2w42-wj39-8g7h/GHSA-2w42-wj39-8g7h.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0646.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0646.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--44bc0445-af22-4a29-8c93-6d7278bf916d.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--44bc0445-af22-4a29-8c93-6d7278bf916d.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0784.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0525","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0671","title":"Roxen WebServer 2.0.x 空字符请求目录遍历漏洞","description":"Roxen WebServer 2.0.69之前版本存在空字节注入漏洞。远程攻击者通过在URL中插入空字符(%00)，可绕过访问控制限制、列出任意目录内容并读取服务器端源代码文件。该漏洞利用无需认证，攻击复杂度低，仅需构造特制HTTP请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0671"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Roxen WebServer 至 2.0.69 或更高版本，该版本已修复空字节注入漏洞。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx/Apache），配置规则拦截 URL 中包含 %00 或空字节的请求，同时限制目录列表功能，确保 Directory Listing 处于关闭状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0307.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0321.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1510","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4965","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0671","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0d17d6f83c6018bb718bcfce6a977efcc0a37796/2000/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0671.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0671.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0671.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0498","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0647","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD MLST命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 版本在处理 MLST 命令时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可在登录服务器之前向目标 FTP 服务发送特制的 MLST 命令，导致服务进程崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者仅需建立 TCP 连接并发送恶意 MLST 指令即可触发，影响 WFTPD 2.4.1/2.4.1 Rc11/2.34/2.40 等多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0647"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"升级 WFTPD 至 2.4.1 RC11 或更高版本，该版本修复了未登录状态下执行 MLST 命令导致服务崩溃的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 WFTPD 配置中禁用 MLST 功能（默认未启用），并在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口 21 的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20102","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0647.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0647","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0647.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0647.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rg84-mjm4-xc43/GHSA-rg84-mjm4-xc43.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752ddd